---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="The story and philosophy behind Onda Ritual."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Why we started Onda Ritual</h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        Onda means "wave" — a reminder that rest moves in cycles, not
        straight lines. We opened Onda Ritual to build a space where that
        idea could be practiced, not just talked about: fewer treatments,
        done properly, with time to breathe between them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values">
    <div class="wrap values-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Unhurried by design</h3>
        <p>
          We book fewer clients per day than a typical studio, so every
          session runs at its own pace rather than the clock's.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Simple, honest pricing</h3>
        <p>
          One price per ritual, shown up front. No memberships to manage, no
          pressure at checkout.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Practitioners who stay</h3>
        <p>
          Our team is small and experienced, so the person who treats you
          today is likely the same one you'll see next time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .intro-copy {
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .values {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
